      "en": "These were the chief officers of King Solomon, even two-hundred fifty, who ruled over the people.",
      "ko": "솔로몬왕의 공장을 감독하는 자가 이백 오십인이라 저희가 백성을 다스렸더라",
      "source_text_hash": "dd919c78187ddda0e88383aef2799b187a6da83156ecf37c94b901d9469e7d9c",
      "translation_text_hash": "1f316d7e62f714181c2d3851291ee91d41cf044ad5ebc059763e6f0a624f5bfa",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
