      "en": "Now all the work of Solomon was accomplished from the day of the foundation of the LORD’s house until it was finished. So the LORD’s house was completed.",
      "ko": "솔로몬이 여호와의 전의 기지를 쌓던 날부터 준공하기까지 범백을 완비하였으므로 여호와의 전이 결점이 없이 필역하니라",
      "source_text_hash": "2279c8cb8b84756cfe3ea08c64e300f0a38363ee5c9841253dfd5e95178e5297",
      "translation_text_hash": "148dbc050e466507363f9f72f3d2670dc368cc36e902e261688e667d64f574f9",
