      "en": "Then Solomon went to Ezion Geber and to Eloth, on the seashore in the land of Edom.",
      "ko": "때에 솔로몬이 에돔 땅의 바닷가 에시온게벨과 엘롯에 이르렀더니",
      "source_text_hash": "ccbfb7d807918017974ee465f047b1981819eaf0a20a2797e0b6aae7b7b0d4d2",
      "translation_text_hash": "87002b2ab2e81a9e3ed887b2ab2b6d955e8b8e19628f406c0f8a9d05e94303e3",
